  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agricultural Development: Paraiba Rural Sustainable Development Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s overall objective is to reduce rural poverty levels, improving food and nutritional security, and strengthening the rural population&apos;s climate change adaptation capacities. The specific objectives are to: (i) increase the adoption of agricultural technologies that contribute to the adaptation and mitigation of climate change, (ii) improve the productive and social inclusion of family farmers, prioritizing women, youth, traditional peoples and communities (PCT) and persons with disabilities, and (iii) improve the environmental conditions of rural communities and their surroundings.</narrative>
  </description>
